 "Repaso": "Review",
 "<b style=\"color:#2b7ec9\">1</b>&nbsp; El sol mueve el ciclo: sin su calor no habría evaporación.": "<b style=\"color:#2b7ec9\">1</b>&nbsp; The sun drives the cycle: without its heat there would be no evaporation.",
 "<b style=\"color:#2b7ec9\">2</b>&nbsp; El agua cambia de estado, pero no se pierde: da vueltas.": "<b style=\"color:#2b7ec9\">2</b>&nbsp; Water changes state, but it isn’t lost: it goes round and round.",
